<title>POLAND: DOMPLAST JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOMPLAST JAN NET FALLS TO PLN 0.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANAURY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.64 vs   0.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.09 vs   1.65</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.06 vs   1.66</p>
<p> Sales		    6.63 vs   6.14</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware maker is</p>
<p>DomPlast SA.</p>
